hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1287","Hazrat Abu Musa Ashari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Jo shakhs hamare muqable me hathyar uthaye woh ham me se nahin hai."
"1288","Hazrat Abu Azza Yasar bin Abd raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Jab Allah azza wa jalla kisi bande ki rooh kisi zameen me qabz karne ka irada farmata hai to us ke liye wahan koi hajat paida farma deta hai."
"1289","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni naak kapde se saaf ki phir farmaya Afsos hai tujh par aye Abu Huraira tu apni naak kapde se saaf karta hai Maine apne aap ko dekha ke main Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ke hujre aur minbar ke darmiyan bhook ki wajah se behosh ho kar gir jata tha to koi shakhs guzarta to kehta ke yeh to majnoon hai halanke mujhe siwaye bhook ke koi marz na tha."
"1290","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Aye Allah ke Rasool ham apne dilon me aisi baat paate hain jise bayan karna ham bahut bara khayal karte hain agarche hamen tamam zameen ki daulat de di jaye to Aap ne farmaya Kya tum ne waqai aisa paya hai Sahaba ne arz kiya Ji haan to Aap ne farmaya Yeh to khalis iman hai."
"1291","Shahr bin Haushab rahimahullah se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Main aur mere khalu Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ki khidmat me hazir hue to ham ne arz kiya Ham me se koi apne seene me aise waswase paata hai ke agar woh unhen zahir kare to us ki akhirat halak ho jaye aur agar woh zahir ho jayen to woh qatl kar diya jaye Hazrat Ayesha ne jab yeh suna to teen martaba Allahu Akbar kaha aur farmaya Is bare me Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sawal kiya gaya to Aap ne farmaya Jab tum me se kisi ko is tarah ka khayal pesh aaye to use teen martaba Allahu Akbar kehna chahiye kyunke momin hi akele is tarah ki baat paata hai."
"1292","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Log barabar aisi cheezon ke bare me sawal karte rahenge jo hone wali nahin hain yahan tak ke kahenge Allah har cheez ka khaliq hai to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya."
"1293","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Badgumani se bacho kyunke badgumani sab se jhooti baat hai aur jasusi na karo aur duniya me ek dusre se aage barhne ki hirs na karo aur ek dusre se munh na phero aur na hasad karo aur na bugz rakho aur Allah ke bando bhai bhai ban jao."
"1294","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni kisi zauja ke paas the ke ek shakhs Aap ke paas se guzra to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use bulaya aur farmaya Aye falan yeh meri zauja falan hain Us shakhs ne kaha Main auron ke bare me to badguman ho sakta hun lekin Aap ke bare me badguman nahin hota To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Beshak shaitan ibne Adam me khoon ke guzarne ki jagah me daudta hai."
"1295","Hazrat Abdullah bin Usman raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Jis ka maal chori ho jaye to woh barabar badgumaniyan karta rehta hai yahan tak ke gunah me chor se aage barh jata hai."
"1296","Bilal bin Sad Ashari rahimahullah se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Hazrat Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ne Hazrat Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu ko likha ke mujhe Damishq ke fasiq logon ke naam likh kar bhejen To unhon ne farmaya Mujhe Damishq ke fasiqon se kya sarokar aur main unhen kahan se pehchanta hun To un ke bete Bilal rahimahullah ne kaha Main Aap ke liye un ke naam likh deta hun chunache unhon ne un ke naam likh diye To Hazrat Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya Tujhe un ke bare me yeh kahan se malum hua aur tujhe kaise pata chala ke woh fasiq hain siwaye is ke ke tu khud un me se ho pas apne aap se shuru karo apna naam likho Phir unhon ne naam likhe aur unhen bheja nahin."
"1297","Abdul Aziz bin Qais rahimahullah se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Main Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar raziyallahu anhuma ke paas aya jabke ek londi un ke baal le rahi thi to unhon ne farmaya Beshak noora ya mehndi khaal ko narm karti hai."
"1298","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Paanch cheezen fitrat me se hain Khatna karna zer-e-naaf baalon ka saaf karna baghlon ke baal ukherna moonchhen katrana aur nakhun tarashna."
"1299","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya paanch cheezen fitrat me se hain khatna aur istehdad aur nakhun tarashna aur baghal ke baal ukhedna aur moonchh katna."
"1300","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya paanch cheezen fitrat me se hain nakhun tarashna aur moonchh katna aur baghal ke baal ukhedna aur istehdad aur khatna."
"1301","Hazrat Abu Tufail raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya ke maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Jiarana me gosht taqseem karte hue dekha aur main us din nau saal ka ladka tha aur main oont ke gosht ke tukde utha raha tha ke itne me ek aurat aap ke pas aayi to aap ne us ke liye apni chadar bichha di pas maine poocha ye kaun hain kaha gaya ye aap ki razai maan hain aap ki wo maan jinhon ne aap ko doodh pilaya tha."
"1302","Hazrat Mughira bin Shuba raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya ek shakhs ne kaha Allah Ameer ko durust rakhe beshak aap ka darban ijazat me use aage karta hai jise wo janta hai to unhon ne farmaya Allah us ka uzr qubool farmaye beshak pehchan kaatne wale kutte aur deewane oont ki jagah par zaroor faida deti hai."
"1303","Hazrat Ibrahim Nakhai rahimahullah ne farmaya ke hamare sathi hamen har khel ki ijazat dete the siwae kutte ke aur Abu Abdullah Bukhari rahimahullah ne farmaya is se murad ladke hain."
"1304","Hazrat Abdul Aziz rahimahullah ne farmaya ke mujhe ek nek sheikh ne khabar di jinhen Abu Uqba kaha jata hai ke main ek martaba Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma ke sath raste me tha pas hamara guzar Habsha ke ladkon ke pas se hua jo khel rahe the to unhon ne do dirham nikale aur unhen de diye."
"1305","Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam meri saheliyon ko mere pas bhejte the jo mere sath gudiyon se khelti thin."
"1306","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek shakhs ko kabutar ke peeche tezi se jata hua dekha to aap ne farmaya ek shaitan hai jo ek shaitana ke peeche tezi se ja raha hai."
"1307","Hazrat Hasan Basri rahimahullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu har juma apne khutbe me kutton ke qatl aur kabutaron ke zibah ka hukm dete the aur ek doosre tareeq me Hazrat Hasan Basri rahimahullah se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu apne khutbe me kutton ke qatl aur kabutaron ke zibah ka hukm dete the."
"1308","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya ke ek din Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu mere pas aaye pas unhon ne ijazat talab ki to maine unhen ijazat di aur mera sar ek laundi ke hath me tha jo use kanghi kar rahi thi pas maine chaha ke apna sar laundi ke hath se nikal loon to Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya use chhor do wo tumhare baal sanware pas maine kaha aye Ameerul Momineen agar aap meri taraf paigham bhejte to main hazir ho jata to Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya kaam mera tha is liye mujhi ko aana chahiye tha."
"1309","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya ke jab koi shakhs logon ke samne thuke to use apni dono hatheliyon se use chhupana chahiye yahan tak ke us ka thook zameen par gire aur jab koi shakhs rozadar ho to use tel lagana chahiye taake us par roze ka asar zahir na ho."
